          "ruleIndex": 1,
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "cra status loads every planted run file into memory without a total size budget\n\n`cra status` reads up to 1000 `*.json` files from the runs folder, each up to 20 MB, and keeps every parsed record in memory, although only the newest and the newest healthy record are used. A folder holding many large files can exhaust memory and make `status` fail."
          },
