        {
          "ruleId": "CWE-345",
          "ruleIndex": 0,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Substituted CISA KEV list is accepted as complete, silently dropping exploited CVEs\n\nThe KEV completeness check in `cra run` accepts any structurally valid KEV list whose count does not fall more than 5% below the highest count seen before. A network attacker who can intercept the CISA KEV download can remove two known-exploited entries and the tool still reports the KEV source as `ok` and the run as complete. A product whose affected component is actively exploited is then downgraded from REPORT CASE to RECORD."
          },
