              ],
              "description": {
                "text": "Reject any new KEV list that does not contain every CVE identifier in the saved copy, and do not allow a count tolerance below the highest count seen. Treat a list that fails this check as `stale` so the run is marked incomplete and the saved copy is kept. Add an authenticity check on the KEV file (a signature or a pinned content hash) before its content is treated as complete, because a structural check cannot detect a replay of the previous list with a newer date. Before merging, confirm CISA's policy on removing entries, since a legitimate removal would then block later downloads until the saved copy is deleted.",
                "markdown": "Reject any new KEV list that does not contain every CVE identifier in the saved copy, and do not allow a count tolerance below the highest count seen. Treat a list that fails this check as `stale` so the run is marked incomplete and the saved copy is kept. Add an authenticity check on the KEV file (a signature or a pinned content hash) before its content is treated as complete, because a structural check cannot detect a replay of the previous list with a newer date. Before merging, confirm CISA's policy on removing entries, since a legitimate removal would then block later downloads until the saved copy is deleted."
              }
