          "message": {
            "text": "Terminal escape / control-character injection into status output — Ruled out: status output: run-file strings (printable) - src/news_watcher.py status_summary and printable()\n\nPlanted run file with ESC, OSC, CR, bidi (U+202E), U+2028, NEL, ZWSP, BOM in source keys, status, detail and finished_at: every control/format char is replaced with '?' by printable() (news_watcher.py printable, applied at status_summary lines ~666-670 and the finished_at lines). Raw-byte check of the output found no 0x1b, 0x07, 0x0d, U+202E, U+0085, U+2028 bytes (work/exp3.out). Hostile text cannot hide a line or fake an 'all clear' from this path; only visible ASCII/printable text remains."
          },
          "locations": [
