            "text": "unchecked exploitation status reported as known not-exploited for components that cannot be looked up — Requires further review: matcher.evaluate component_unknown path (components without purl, status not OK)\n\nSame invariant as the reported row: the code passes exploited_known=kev_ok, so a no-purl component with a fresh KEV list shows exploited_known True and HUMAN_REVIEW. Not filed because the fix changes the urgency of every component without a purl (for example demo smartheat-firmware-core moves from HUMAN_REVIEW to URGENT_HUMAN_REVIEW). That is a product policy decision for the maintainers, not a clear logic error."
