          "message": {
            "text": "wrong next-step action for a status and exploitation combination; package summary hiding an affected version — No issue identified: matcher.action_for and summarize_packages (action table, per-package summary)\n\naction_for matches the table in PLAN.md Part 3 and CLAUDE rules for all status x exploited x known combinations (AFFECTED+KEV=REPORT_CASE, UNKNOWN+exploited=URGENT, AFFECTED not known=URGENT). summarize_packages is max-over-versions by documented design (cli prints the legend), so one AFFECTED version marks the package AFFECTED; it never downgrades. Demo run on demo-data fixtures gave AFFECTED for log4j-core and requests as expected."
