            "text": "Decompression bomb / zip bomb via Content-Encoding — Ruled out: news_watcher.http_fetch content decoding (Content-Encoding gzip) and decompression bombs\n\nThe code never decodes the body: urllib does not add Accept-Encoding and http_fetch joins raw bytes (news_watcher.py http_fetch). Dynamic: a server sending Content-Encoding: gzip for 200 MB of expanded data returned the raw 915 KB compressed bytes unchanged; the JSON parse then failed as 'not valid JSON'. No expansion occurs, so the size cap applies to the wire bytes only."
