            "text": "parser resource exhaustion, unhandled exception on crafted SBOM — No issue identified: sbom_reader.load_sbom parser limits (_check_depth, _read_limited, duplicate keys, NaN/Infinity, big ints, MAX_COMPONENTS, nested components walk)\n\nBoundary tests: 32 nested levels accepted, 33 rejected, escaped quotes and brackets inside strings handled, nested components chain of 20 rejected by depth; 5001 components rejected and 5000 accepted; duplicate keys, NaN and -Infinity rejected; 5000-digit integer rejected as SbomError (int digit limit). Fuzzed 30000 random component dicts and 3000 mutated SBOM files (junk bytes, NaN tokens, lone surrogates, BOMs, huge numbers): zero exceptions other than SbomError. Adversarial 7 MB file of empty dicts parses in 0.8 s with about 206 MB peak RSS; 5000 components with 1.5 KB text parse in 0.55 s. Caps hold; no bypass found."
