            "text": "Deep nesting, oversized integers, invalid UTF-8, NaN; parser crash from feed content — Ruled out: news_watcher._json_loads, _read_json, _parse_time (parser limits on feed and cache JSON)\n\nNamed control: _json_loads catches ValueError and RecursionError and raises FetchError (news_watcher.py _json_loads); _read_json catches OSError, ValueError and RecursionError and returns None. Dynamic: 200000-deep nesting, 6000-digit integer and invalid UTF-8 each raised FetchError; the same deep nesting in a cache file returned None. NaN is accepted by json.loads but only ever reaches type-checked fields (count, dates), which reject non-int/non-string values."
