            "text": "Retry amplification / unbounded retries from feed status codes — No issue identified: news_watcher._fetch_json retry policy and sleep backoff\n\nCode review of _fetch_json: retries only on status None, 429 or >=500, with RETRIES=3 and delays 1, 2, 4 s; other 4xx raise at once. Existing tests cover 429 retry and 404 no-retry. Retry count is fixed, so a feed cannot make it unbounded; slow-response time is the separate deadline finding."
