              "risk_area": "Partial or torn cache reads; temp file leftovers; races between reader and writer",
              "surface": "news_watcher._write_json_atomic and _read_json (temp file handling, concurrent readers during replace)",
              "recorded_by": "Feed Fetch and Cache Agent",
              "source": "agent_reported"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "strix-coverage/run-marked-complete-while-a-source-or-component-was-not-checked",
          "ruleIndex": 61,
          "kind": "pass",
          "level": "none",
          "message": {
            "text": "Run marked complete while a source or component was not checked — No issue identified: news_watcher.run_is_complete, Feeds.sources_ok and Feeds.complete (completeness aggregation)\n\nThe aggregation is correct: complete requires every source status 'ok', unchecked == 0 and checked > 0, and run_is_complete requires complete is True and every recorded source 'ok'. The false 'complete' in the reported KEV finding comes from the KEV source status (vuln-0007), not from this aggregation. Checked a run with an UNKNOWN component (complete False) and a failed OSV source (complete False) in the reproducer runs."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "logicalLocations": [
                {
                  "fullyQualifiedName": "news_watcher.run_is_complete, Feeds.sources_ok and Feeds.complete (completeness aggregation)"
                }
